---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Neo Mind Flow" description="How Neo Mind Flow collects, uses, and protects your data.">
  <main class="container page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated"><em>Last updated: August 20, 2026</em></p>

    <p>
      Neo Mind Flow ("we", "us", "our") operates the website blog.neomindflow.cloud
      (the "Site"). This page explains what information we collect, how we use it,
      and the choices you have.
    </p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect limited information automatically when you visit the Site,
      including your IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited,
      and time spent on pages. This is standard analytics data used to understand
      how the Site is used.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use <strong>Google Analytics (GA4)</strong> and <strong>Microsoft
      Clarity</strong> to understand how visitors interact with the Site. These
      services use cookies and similar technologies to collect anonymized usage
      data. You can learn more about how these services handle data on their
      respective privacy pages. You can also block cookies in your browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Neo Mind Flow is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program.
      When you click a link to Amazon and make a purchase, we may earn a commission
      at no additional cost to you. These links use a cookie to attribute the
      referral, which typically expires after 24 hours.
    </p>

    <h2>How we use your information</h2>
    <p>
      We use analytics data solely to improve the Site and understand what content
      is helpful. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with
      third parties for their own marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies only for analytics (as described above) and to remember your
      theme preference (light or dark mode). You can disable cookies in your browser;
      the Site will continue to function.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings at any time.
      You can also opt out of Google Analytics using Google's
      <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">opt-out browser add-on</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this policy, contact us through our
      <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'contact/'}>contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .page h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
  }
  .page h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
